        "text": "Base rate/reference class: for a one-month-ahead level forecast on this utilization rate, persistence from the latest exact MCUMFN value is the main prior because monthly movements in utilization are small relative to the level. The last three rounded official NAICS readings all sit at 75.6, while the exact latest is 75.5559."
